# A miss of instanceof in a copy that hands the value back asks for the shapes that the answer is expected to have, in front of the walk up the chain.
# RUN: walk f4:Body mechanisms=all
# CHECK: = ShapeTest {{*}}layouts=[L0] {{*}}:1
# CHECK: = ShapeTest {{*}}layouts=[L0, L1] {{*}}:1
